
@startuml
title Projectory - Portfolio Creation & Management
autonumber

actor Student
participant "React Frontend" as React
participant "FastAPI Backend" as API
database "PostgreSQL / Supabase" as DB

Student -> React: Open My Portfolio
React -> API: Request portfolio information
API -> DB: Retrieve student's portfolio data
DB --> API: Personal info, education, skills, experience
API --> React: Return portfolio information
React --> Student: Display portfolio sections

Student -> React: Click Edit Portfolio
React --> Student: Display editing form

Student -> React: Add or update portfolio information

note right of React
  Personal information (R3)
  Education records (R4)
  Skills (R5)
  Experience records (R6)
end note

Student -> React: Click Save Changes
React -> API: Submit updated portfolio data

API -> API: Validate data and user authorization

alt Invalid data or unauthorized user
    API --> React: Return error response
    React --> Student: Display error message

else Valid and authorized
    API -> DB: Insert or update portfolio records
    DB --> API: Confirm saved changes
    API --> React: Return updated portfolio
    React --> Student: Display updated portfolio
end

@enduml
